WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
It was a Tuesday after an ugly win

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.750
And I was flying higher than
Coach Foerster before an OL meeting

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.000
That's when he walked in

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.333
Fresh off his first win. He was 6'5" with a bolo tie

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:12.541
And a face that was downright

00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:13.541
punchable

00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:15.083
I want to report missing persons

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:15.888
Who's missin'?

00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:18.125
The Los Angeles football fans

00:00:21.372 --> 00:00:24.135
Damn, where were all those L.A. Chargers fans?

00:00:24.135 --> 00:00:25.250
Kidnapped?

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.000
Dead?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.161
Watching preseason Lonzo Ball?

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.660
I wasn't sure, but I knew who I wanted to talk to

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.309
Someone who actually had fans in that dinky stadium

00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:36.541
Mr. Wentz, where did you get all those fans in L.A.?

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:38.706
I don't know.  Philly? North Dakota?

00:00:38.706 --> 00:00:39.708
Check the wagon, Suh

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:40.610
It's clean

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:42.303
Just some bibles and the other Kelce

00:00:42.303 --> 00:00:43.681
Let's bring him in for questioning

00:00:43.681 --> 00:00:45.359
What the

00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:48.008
Looks like he eluded the sack

00:00:48.008 --> 00:00:49.708
Kid reminds me of a young me

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:51.019
If I ever had passion for the game

00:00:51.019 --> 00:00:52.236
Where to now?

00:00:52.236 --> 00:00:55.333
It's L.A., there's got to be football fans

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:56.769
Somewhere

00:00:56.769 --> 00:00:59.230
I think I've got our next move

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:00.208
I give up

